@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### Create a company (201 + Location)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Microsoft",
  "websiteUrl": "https://www.microsoft.com"
}

### Acronym match: International Business Machines ↔ ibm.com (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "International Business Machines",
  "websiteUrl": "https://www.ibm.com"
}

### Name not relevant to the website (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Apple",
  "websiteUrl": "https://www.amazon.com"
}

### Invalid fields (400, one error per field)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "websiteUrl": "not-a-url"
}

### Duplicate website domain (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Microsoft Corporation",
  "websiteUrl": "https://microsoft.com"
}

### List all companies (paged)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies

### Filter by partial name and/or domain
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?name=micro&domain=microsoft.com

### Relevance-ranked search
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?q=micro

### Sorting and paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?sort=-createdAt&page=1&pageSize=5

### Empty result (200 with no items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?name=zzz

### Unknown id (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/0199e9a0-0000-7000-8000-000000000000

### Malformed id (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/not-a-guid
